BT 1 0 0 1 0 23.5 Tm 17.5 TL /F1 11.5 Tf .14902 .141176 .113725 rg (Years ago, like a lot of people, I watched ) Tj /F3 11.5 Tf (The Secret) Tj /F1 11.5 Tf (. I have to be honest with you: it) Tj T* (struck me as a half-truth. The half that was missing is what bothered me for years.) Tj T* ET
